    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2048- The Perfect Fusion of Minimalist Digital Art and Strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the globally popular classic puzzle game, slide blocks with fingertips and challenge the ultimate goal of &quot;2048&quot; by merging the same numbers! The rules are simple yet full of depth, and each step requires careful planning, testing your logical thinking and spatial strategy abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swipe the screen to collide and merge blocks of the same number (2+2=4, 4+4=8...)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each operation generates new numbers, and the game ends when the chessboard is filled</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accumulate high scores to challenge global rankings and unlock rare achievement badges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suitable for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba Casual players: 3-minute quick game, commuting tool to relieve boredom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba Strategy enthusiast: Deep computing planning for optimal merging path</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25ba Achievement collection control: 20+hidden challenges waiting to be unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you break through the ultimate barrier of 2048? Join this Zen game in the digital world and create infinite possibilities with wisdom</p>",
